# Deployment Rules

*   **GitHub Repository**: `https://github.com/vaynestar/PropMateTest`
*   **Vercel Project**: `prop-mate-test`
*   **Live URL**: `https://prop-mate-test.vercel.app`

## Vercel Deployment Instructions
When deploying changes to Vercel, **DO NOT** use the `npx vercel --prod` command via the CLI, as this will create a disconnected project and fail to update the live environment.

Instead, push all commits directly to the GitHub repository:
```bash
git add .
git commit -m "your commit message"
git push
```
Vercel is linked to this repository and will automatically trigger a production build and deploy to the `prop-mate-test` environment.
